{"id":"std/Random/Ascon","kind":"std","title":"std.Random.Ascon","sourcePath":"std/Random/Ascon.zig","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/std/#std.Random.Ascon","file":"std/Random/Ascon.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon","text":"std.Random.Ascon"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy","text":"std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.Ascon","text":"std.Random.Ascon.Ascon"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.fill","text":"std.Random.Ascon.fill"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.init","text":"std.Random.Ascon.init"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.mem","text":"std.Random.Ascon.mem"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.random","text":"std.Random.Ascon.random"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.rate","text":"std.Random.Ascon.rate"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length","text":"std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.Self","text":"std.Random.Ascon.Self"},{"depth":3,"slug":"std.Random.Ascon.std","text":"std.Random.Ascon.std"},{"depth":2,"slug":"source","text":"源码"}],"symbols":[{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:1:23356","name":"std.Random.Ascon","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon","category":"container","sourceLine":1},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:30:23364","name":"std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy","category":"function","sourceLine":30},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:15:23360","name":"std.Random.Ascon.Ascon","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.Ascon","category":"type","sourceLine":15},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:47:23366","name":"std.Random.Ascon.fill","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.fill","category":"function","sourceLine":47},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:23:23363","name":"std.Random.Ascon.init","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.init","category":"function","sourceLine":23},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:12:23358","name":"std.Random.Ascon.mem","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.mem","category":"alias","sourceLine":12},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:42:23365","name":"std.Random.Ascon.random","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.random","category":"function","sourceLine":42},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:19:23361","name":"std.Random.Ascon.rate","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.rate","category":"constant","sourceLine":19},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:20:23362","name":"std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length","category":"constant","sourceLine":20},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:13:23359","name":"std.Random.Ascon.Self","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.Self","category":"alias","sourceLine":13},{"id":"std/Random/Ascon.zig:11:23357","name":"std.Random.Ascon.std","anchor":"std.Random.Ascon.std","category":"alias","sourceLine":11}],"html":"<div id=\"std.Random.Ascon\"></div>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">第 1 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>基于 Reverie 构造的密码学安全伪随机数生成器。Reverie 是具有前向安全性的置换式伪随机数生成器，此处采用 Ascon(128,12,8) 置换实例化。</p>\n<p>与 ChaCha 相比，此生成器的状态小得多，可能更适合资源受限环境。</p>\n<p>参考文献：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一种提高效率的稳健海绵式伪随机数生成器 <a href=\"https://eprint.iacr.org/2016/886.pdf\">https://eprint.iacr.org/2016/886.pdf</a></li>\n<li>Ascon <a href=\"https://ascon.iaik.tugraz.at/files/asconv12-nist.pdf\">https://ascon.iaik.tugraz.at/files/asconv12-nist.pdf</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>state: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.Ascon\">Ascon</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/mem/#std.mem\"><code>mem</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\"><code>Self</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.Ascon\"><code>Ascon</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\"><code>rate</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\"><code>secret_seed_length</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.init\"><code>init</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy\"><code>addEntropy</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.random\"><code>random</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.fill\"><code>fill</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.addEntropy</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L30\">第 30 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>注入熵以刷新内部状态。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">addEntropy</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>, bytes: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>bytes: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.Ascon\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.Ascon</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">类型</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L15\">第 15 行</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.fill\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.fill</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L47\">第 47 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>使用随机字节填充缓冲区。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">fill</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>, buf: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>buf: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.init\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.init</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L23\">第 23 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>种子必须均匀、保密，且长度为 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\">secret_seed_length</a></code> 字节。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">init</span>(secret_seed: [<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\">secret_seed_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>secret_seed: [<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\">secret_seed_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.mem\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.mem</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L12\">第 12 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/mem/#std.mem\"><code>std.mem</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.random\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.random</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L42\">第 42 行</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>返回由当前随机数生成器提供支持的 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/#std.Random\">std.Random</a></code> 结构体。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">random</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/#std.Random\">Random</a></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.rate\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.rate</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L19\">第 19 行</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L20\">第 20 行</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.Self\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.Self</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L13\">第 13 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\"><code>std.Random.Ascon</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.Random.Ascon.std\"><h3><code>std.Random.Ascon.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L11\">第 11 行</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<details class=\"source-code\" id=\"source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><summary>源码</summary><p><code>std/Random/Ascon.zig</code></p><div class=\"source-grid\"><pre class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-copy-ignore=\"\"><code><a id=\"L1\" href=\"#L1\" tabindex=\"-1\">1</a>\n<a id=\"L2\" href=\"#L2\" tabindex=\"-1\">2</a>\n<a id=\"L3\" href=\"#L3\" tabindex=\"-1\">3</a>\n<a id=\"L4\" href=\"#L4\" tabindex=\"-1\">4</a>\n<a id=\"L5\" href=\"#L5\" tabindex=\"-1\">5</a>\n<a id=\"L6\" href=\"#L6\" tabindex=\"-1\">6</a>\n<a id=\"L7\" href=\"#L7\" tabindex=\"-1\">7</a>\n<a id=\"L8\" href=\"#L8\" tabindex=\"-1\">8</a>\n<a id=\"L9\" href=\"#L9\" tabindex=\"-1\">9</a>\n<a id=\"L10\" href=\"#L10\" tabindex=\"-1\">10</a>\n<a id=\"L11\" href=\"#L11\" tabindex=\"-1\">11</a>\n<a id=\"L12\" href=\"#L12\" tabindex=\"-1\">12</a>\n<a id=\"L13\" href=\"#L13\" tabindex=\"-1\">13</a>\n<a id=\"L14\" href=\"#L14\" tabindex=\"-1\">14</a>\n<a id=\"L15\" href=\"#L15\" tabindex=\"-1\">15</a>\n<a id=\"L16\" href=\"#L16\" tabindex=\"-1\">16</a>\n<a id=\"L17\" href=\"#L17\" tabindex=\"-1\">17</a>\n<a id=\"L18\" href=\"#L18\" tabindex=\"-1\">18</a>\n<a id=\"L19\" href=\"#L19\" tabindex=\"-1\">19</a>\n<a id=\"L20\" href=\"#L20\" tabindex=\"-1\">20</a>\n<a id=\"L21\" href=\"#L21\" tabindex=\"-1\">21</a>\n<a id=\"L22\" href=\"#L22\" tabindex=\"-1\">22</a>\n<a id=\"L23\" href=\"#L23\" tabindex=\"-1\">23</a>\n<a id=\"L24\" href=\"#L24\" tabindex=\"-1\">24</a>\n<a id=\"L25\" href=\"#L25\" tabindex=\"-1\">25</a>\n<a id=\"L26\" href=\"#L26\" tabindex=\"-1\">26</a>\n<a id=\"L27\" href=\"#L27\" tabindex=\"-1\">27</a>\n<a id=\"L28\" href=\"#L28\" tabindex=\"-1\">28</a>\n<a id=\"L29\" href=\"#L29\" tabindex=\"-1\">29</a>\n<a id=\"L30\" href=\"#L30\" tabindex=\"-1\">30</a>\n<a id=\"L31\" href=\"#L31\" tabindex=\"-1\">31</a>\n<a id=\"L32\" href=\"#L32\" tabindex=\"-1\">32</a>\n<a id=\"L33\" href=\"#L33\" tabindex=\"-1\">33</a>\n<a id=\"L34\" href=\"#L34\" tabindex=\"-1\">34</a>\n<a id=\"L35\" href=\"#L35\" tabindex=\"-1\">35</a>\n<a id=\"L36\" href=\"#L36\" tabindex=\"-1\">36</a>\n<a id=\"L37\" href=\"#L37\" tabindex=\"-1\">37</a>\n<a id=\"L38\" href=\"#L38\" tabindex=\"-1\">38</a>\n<a id=\"L39\" href=\"#L39\" tabindex=\"-1\">39</a>\n<a id=\"L40\" href=\"#L40\" tabindex=\"-1\">40</a>\n<a id=\"L41\" href=\"#L41\" tabindex=\"-1\">41</a>\n<a id=\"L42\" href=\"#L42\" tabindex=\"-1\">42</a>\n<a id=\"L43\" href=\"#L43\" tabindex=\"-1\">43</a>\n<a id=\"L44\" href=\"#L44\" tabindex=\"-1\">44</a>\n<a id=\"L45\" href=\"#L45\" tabindex=\"-1\">45</a>\n<a id=\"L46\" href=\"#L46\" tabindex=\"-1\">46</a>\n<a id=\"L47\" href=\"#L47\" tabindex=\"-1\">47</a>\n<a id=\"L48\" href=\"#L48\" tabindex=\"-1\">48</a>\n<a id=\"L49\" href=\"#L49\" tabindex=\"-1\">49</a>\n<a id=\"L50\" href=\"#L50\" tabindex=\"-1\">50</a>\n<a id=\"L51\" href=\"#L51\" tabindex=\"-1\">51</a>\n<a id=\"L52\" href=\"#L52\" tabindex=\"-1\">52</a>\n<a id=\"L53\" href=\"#L53\" tabindex=\"-1\">53</a>\n<a id=\"L54\" href=\"#L54\" tabindex=\"-1\">54</a>\n<a id=\"L55\" href=\"#L55\" tabindex=\"-1\">55</a>\n<a id=\"L56\" href=\"#L56\" tabindex=\"-1\">56</a>\n<a id=\"L57\" href=\"#L57\" tabindex=\"-1\">57</a>\n<a id=\"L58\" href=\"#L58\" tabindex=\"-1\">58</a></code></pre><pre class=\"source-listing\"><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 基于 Reverie 构造的密码学安全伪随机数生成器。Reverie 是具有前向安全性的置换式伪随机数生成器，此处采用 Ascon(128,12,8) 置换实例化。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//!</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 与 ChaCha 相比，此生成器的状态小得多，可能更适合资源受限环境。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//!</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 参考文献：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//! - 一种提高效率的稳健海绵式伪随机数生成器 https://eprint.iacr.org/2016/886.pdf</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//! - Ascon https://ascon.iaik.tugraz.at/files/asconv12-nist.pdf</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//!</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//!</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> mem = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/mem/#std.mem\">mem</a>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Self = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@This</span>();\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Ascon = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/#std.crypto\">crypto</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/#std.crypto.core\">core</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/crypto/ascon/#std.crypto.ascon.State\">Ascon</a>(.little);\n\nstate: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.Ascon\">Ascon</a>,\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> rate = <span class=\"tok-number\">16</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> secret_seed_length = <span class=\"tok-number\">32</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 种子必须均匀、保密，且长度为 `secret_seed_length` 字节。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">init</span>(secret_seed: [<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\">secret_seed_length</a>]<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> self = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>{ .state = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.Ascon\">Ascon</a>.<a href=\"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/std/#std.Random.Ascon.Ascon.initXof\">initXof</a>() };\n    self.addEntropy(&amp;secret_seed);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> self;\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 注入熵以刷新内部状态。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">addEntropy</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>, bytes: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug\">debug</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug.assert\">assert</a>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.secret_seed_length\">secret_seed_length</a> % <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\">rate</a> == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>);\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (i + <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\">rate</a> &lt; bytes.len) : (i += <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\">rate</a>) {\n        self.state.addBytes(bytes[i..][<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\">rate</a>]);\n        self.state.permuteR(<span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>);\n    }\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (i != bytes.len) self.state.addBytes(bytes[i..]);\n    self.state.permute();\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 返回由当前随机数生成器提供支持的 `std.Random` 结构体。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">random</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/#std.Random\">Random</a> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/#std.Random\">Random</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/#std.Random.init\">init</a>(self, <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.fill\">fill</a>);\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 使用随机字节填充缓冲区。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">fill</span>(self: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon\">Self</a>, buf: []<span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> i: <span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span> = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> left = buf.len - i;\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> n = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@min</span>(left, <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\">rate</a>);\n        self.state.extractBytes(buf[i..][<span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>..n]);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (left == <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>) <span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span>;\n        self.state.permuteR(<span class=\"tok-number\">8</span>);\n        i += n;\n    }\n    self.state.permuteRatchet(<span class=\"tok-number\">6</span>, <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Random/Ascon/#std.Random.Ascon.rate\">rate</a>);\n}\n</code></pre></div></details>"}
